      "statement": "Each page worker is a fresh bounded DeepAgent whose only completion tool is submit_page, a DynamicStructuredTool whose schema requires at least one Claim each with a non-empty statement and at least one evidence resource; a worker-scoped flag throws on a second call, and the runner throws if the worker exits without submitting.",
